1
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,820
本周 地球上少了一位伟人
This week, the world lost a great man,

2
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,360
而我也失去了一位良师
and I lost a mentor.

3
00:00:14,613 --> 00:00:18,940
近60年来 "马戏王"教授艾尔·尤兹利
For nearly 60 years, Professor Ringmaster Al Uzielli

4
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,240
帮助像我一样有天赋的年轻人 找到自己的小丑形象
helped young hopefuls like me find their clown persona.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,100
"马戏王"教授
"Professor Ringmaster"?

6
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,200
那在小丑学校可是威望很高的头衔
It's a very prestigious title at clown college.

7
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,686
仅次于"派王"将军
One step below Piemaster General.

8
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,300
路易斯在哪儿
Where's Lewis?

9
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,200
谁知道呢
Who knows?

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,860
好了 各位 就咱们吧
Okay, guys, it's just us.

11
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,020
响三声一起抬
Lift on three.

12
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:22,660
你们怎么没接受我的好友请求呢
Hey, how come you guys haven't accepted my friend requests?

13
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:24,020
我都不知道你还玩Facebook
I didn't know you were on facebook.

14
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:25,800
没错 你说只有青少年
Yeah. You said it was only for teenagers

15
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,100
或是想"约炮"的才玩那个
and people looking to have affairs.

16
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,240
我发觉要是你抵抗不了诱惑
Well, I figured if you can't fight it...

17
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:31,160
不是说"炮友"的诱惑 搞外遇是不对的
not the having the affair. That's still bad.

18
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:33,900
不 不是那个 可想和老朋友叙叙旧
No. Not that, but there's nothing wrong with catching up

19
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,240
也没有错 对吧
with a few old friends, right?

20
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:39,528
或者和至交好友社交网络一把
Or doing a little social networking with by B.F.F.S?

21
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:42,820
是社交网络还是社交无能啊
Social networking or social not-working?

22
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,540
咱们应该这么做
Oh! You know what we gotta do?

23
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:46,500
大家一起在船上拍张照
We gotta get a picture of us all together on a boat.

24
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,000
我觉得现在正流行这个
I think that's a thing now.

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,080
怎么样 接受我的好友请求吧
So what do you say? Accept my friend thingy.

26
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:54,060
抱歉了妈 我没收到你的好友请求
Sorry, mom, I-I didn't get a friend thingy from you.

27
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:56,420
那网站为了保护孩子不被变态骚扰
Yeah, you know, they have a lot of blocks on there

28
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,840
设置了很多屏障
to protect kids from weirdos.

29
00:01:58,653 --> 00:02:01,000
好吧 好吧 我会再发一次的
Mm. Okay. Good, good. I'll send it again.

30
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,540
-好极了 -一定要发哦
- Great. - Please do.

31
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:03,740
千万别发啊
Please don't.

32
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:06,340
我们收到了她的请求 不过把它忽略了
We got her request the first time, but ignored it.

33
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,360
我可不能让她在网上探听
I can't have her on there snooping around

34
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,460
我在派对上的所作所为
seeing what I'm doing at parties.

35
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,680
或者上传我们全家去度假时穿着
Or posting pictures of us on family vacations

36
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,140
过时又傻气的衣服拍的照片
wearing old, dorky clothes.

37
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,220
干嘛 我这件又怎么了
What? What's wrong with this?

38
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:21,260
老爸快看 我做了个巨无霸的奥利奥
Dad, check it out. I made one giant Oreo.

39
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:24,300
卢克 你这是干嘛啊
Luke, what are you doing?

40
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,880
你该像啃玉米棒子那么吃才对
You gotta eat it like it's an ear of corn.

41
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:27,880
太有才了
Genius.

42
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:31,280
-哇 新西装啊 -一切都是新的
- Wow. New suit? - New everything.

43
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:34,280
孩子们 围过来 人生讲座的时间到了
Kids, gather 'round. It's time for a life lesson.

44
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,000
我们不是都在这儿了吗
Aren't we already gathered?

45
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:38,180
让我来告诉你们
Let me tell you something.

46
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:43,240
努力 决心 坚持 就是成功三秘诀
Hard work, determination, and perseverance always win out.

47
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:47,240
好人也能成功 我就是活生生的证据
I am living proof that nice guys can finish first.

48
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:50,420
今天我将有机会接到我职业生涯中最大的一笔代理
Today I have a chance to get the biggest listing of my career.

49
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:52,980
我从未见过他如此全力以赴的样子
Oh, I have never seen this man so focused.

50
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,820
我就像是大赛前夕的拳击手
I'm like a boxer before the big fight.

51
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,360
所以我昨晚都没和克莱尔做爱
That's why I didn't have sex with Claire last night.

52
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:58,480
抱歉哦 亲爱的
Sorry, honey.

53
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,021
不 没关系
Mm. It's--it's okay.

54
00:03:00,021 --> 00:03:02,056
不过只要我拿到了代理 马上就能 顶
But as soon as I get this listing--ding!

55
00:03:02,056 --> 00:03:04,141
别说了 别说了
Let's just stop. Stop.

56
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,280
我都瞧见了
I see you.

57
00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:11,380
啥 我挠痒痒而已
What? I'm scratching.

58
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,300
妈妈
Hey, mom?

59
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:16,640
我明天能让朋友来家里玩吗
Is it okay if I have a friend come over tomorrow?

60
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:20,820
谁 罗本吗 还是一紧张就流鼻血的那个
Who? Reuben? Or the nervous one that gets the nosebleed?

61
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:21,540
是格里芬·库普
It's Griffin Cooper.

62
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:22,780
格里芬·库普
Griffin Cooper?

63
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:25,160
格里芬·库普是至今为止
Griffin Cooper is, by far,

64
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,440
曼尼年级中最酷的孩子
the coolest kid in Manny's grade.

65
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,200
他是个运动健将 充满自信
He's a terrific athlete, he's confident.

66
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:31,420
当然 曼尼也是个好孩子 可是他算不上酷
Manny's a great kid, sure, but he's not exactly cool.

67
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,720
他连开个门都很二逼
He can't even open a door cool.

68
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:37,340
您好啊 怀亚特 真高兴你能来和我共度
Salutations, Wyatt. I'm so glad you're joining me

69
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:38,520
一个充满欢乐的下午
for an afternoon of mirth.

70
00:03:39,410 --> 00:03:41,500
晚安 罗本桑
Ah, good evening, Reuben-san.

71
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,280
请你脱鞋好吗
May I ask you to remove your shoes?

72
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:44,840
今晚我们走日系风
Tonight, we are going Japanese.

73
00:03:45,497 --> 00:03:49,518
*（）&……*……&……*（）*
Ah! Hebalaboo ridabeley lai mubay rumboo.

74
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:51,340
我今早发明了一种新的语言
I invented a new language this morning.

75
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:53,240
你们什么时候变成好朋友的
When did you guys become buddies?

76
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,060
是在打橄榄球时
Was it a football game in the yard?

77
00:03:55,060 --> 00:03:57,180
-你接了个好球吗 -不 没有那种事
- You made a great catch? - No, that didn't happen.

78
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:59,820
不过图书馆馆长说我以后会是抢手货的
But the librarian told me one day I'll be a great catch.

79
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,620
我真是没搞懂他们的关系
I'm really not getting that relationship.

80
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,760
你怎么就不能为曼尼交到新朋友而高兴呢
Why can't you just be happy that Manny's making new friends?

81
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:09,640
可这事根本说不通啊
No. 'cause it doesn't add up.

82
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,140
像格里芬·库普那样的酷小孩
Cool kids like Griffin Cooper--

83
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:12,660
可不会和曼尼这样的闷货玩在一起
They don't hang out with kids like Manny.

84
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,140
曼尼也很酷好不好
Manny's very cool.

85
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:17,020
也许那些孩子终于能理解曼尼那"高深的酷"了
Maybe those kids are finally catching up to him.

86
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,600
等等 我懂了
Wait a minute. I get it.

87
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:21,200
前几天
Couple of days last week,

88
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:23,120
我骑摩托车载曼尼去上学
I took Manny to school on my motorcycle.

89
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,720
格里芬肯定觉得我屌爆了
Griffin must think I'm pretty boss.

90
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:29,200
没错 杰 都是冲着你来的
Yes, Jay. It's all because of you.

91
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:31,220
小孩子就是在寻找偶像和榜样
Kids are looking for role models.

92
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,280
不然你觉得为啥方茨那么受欢迎
Why do you think Fonzie was so popular?

93
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,400
他让人们觉得自己很有钱
He told people that they were rich,

94
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,880
其实却用计偷走了他们的钱
but really took their money with his scheme?

95
00:04:38,020 --> 00:04:40,060
不 才不是那样
No, that's a...

96
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:40,640
你说得对
Yes.

97
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:43,520
那些人是"方氏骗局"的受害者
Those people were victims of a Fonzie scheme.

98
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,060
好戏即将开场
It's showtime.

99
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,020
嘿 邓菲
Hey, Dunphy.

100
00:04:57,991 --> 00:05:00,569
准备好你的"独女戏"了吗
You gettin' ready for your one-woman show?

101
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:00,980
米茨
Mitzi.

102
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,180
米茨·罗斯 高档房地产世界中
Mitzi Roth-- a notorious poacher

103
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:06,460
臭名昭著的抢食者
in the world of high-end residential real estate.

104
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:09,040
我们叫她"榆树街的猛鬼"
We call her the "Nightmare on Elm Street,"

105
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,640
因为她卖了许多榆树街上的房子
Because she sold a lot of houses on Elm Street.

106
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,100
米茨 你来干嘛
What are you doing here, Mitzi?

107
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:15,940
我约了人 此房归我代理了
I have an appointment. This is my listing.

108
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:18,540
我看这事还没准吧 小哥
Oh, I didn't think that was dotted line yet, jazz hands.

109
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:21,420
别担心 我可能有个客户有兴趣
No worries. I may have an interested buyer.

110
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:22,280
我会介绍给你的
I'll bring him to you.

111
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:22,680
真的吗
Really?

112
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,660
好吧 但你能不能待会再回来
Okay, but could you come back later?

113
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,220
我现在得去见他们了
I really need to have them to myself right now.

114
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:28,560
好的 没问题 我完全理解
Oh, yeah, okay. I completely understand.

115
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:29,700
-谢谢 -不客气
- Okay, thanks. - You're welcome.

116
00:05:31,020 --> 00:05:32,000
慢着 搞毛
Wait. What?

117
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:34,140
你这是干什么
What are you doing?

118
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,220
看我的
Watch this.

119
00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:37,060
-喂 -喂 我是米茨·罗斯
- Hello? - Oh, it's Mitzi Roth.

120
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:39,220
-还有菲尔·邓菲 -我有个买家
- And Phil Dunphy. - I may have a prospective buyer

121
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:40,420
有点想买你家房子
for your beautiful house.

122
00:05:40,420 --> 00:05:42,620
-请问能否让我进屋 -嘿 斯坦 嘿 帕蒂
- I was wondering if maybe I could come in... - Hey, Stan! Hey, Patti!

123
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:44,060
能让我进屋参观一下吗
and just have a look for a little while.

124
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:46,040
-我们有很多事要谈 -请进吧
- We've got a lot to talk about. - Come on in.

125
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,020
喂 哥们 是我
Hey, guys. Yeah.

126
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:51,360
我想着多个人给点意见总是好的
I'm wondering if maybe we shouldn't be alone for this.

127
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,402
我进来了[我要搅局]
I'm in.

128
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:56,100
邓菲 你继续在低端市场打拼吧
Go back to condos, Dunphy.

129
00:05:56,840 --> 00:06:00,820
我的天呐 你们家房子太美了
Oh, my god! This place is absolutely gorgeous.

130
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,480
迷人 惊艳
Stunning. Stunning.

131
00:06:02,780 --> 00:06:06,200
-菲尔帮你们干得不错嘛 -嘿
- You are in such good hands with Phil. - Hey.

132
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,240
你们好
How are you guys?

133
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:08,880
虽然我真心希望它们好
I mean, fingers crossed, though.

134
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:11,340
但我得告诉你 很多新公司都经营不善
You know, so many new companies go belly-up.

135
00:06:11,701 --> 00:06:14,000
-糟透了 -好吧 米茨 你可以走了
- Terrible. - Well, good to-- good to see you, Mitzi.

136
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,380
-你们好 -没事没事 不用走
- Guys, how are you? - Oh, no. No, no, it's fine.It's fine.

137
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:17,340
进屋看看吧
Come and take a look.

138
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:18,070
谢谢你
Oh, thank you.

139
00:06:19,180 --> 00:06:20,920
-谢谢 -米茨 别捣乱
- Thank you. - Mitzi, please!

140
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,460
米茨 求你了 求你了
Mitzi, please! Please!

141
00:06:22,780 --> 00:06:25,240
-你这是干嘛 -老天啊 他推我
- What are you doing? - Oh, my god! He shoved me!

142
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,586
-什么 -他推我
- What?! - He shoved me!

143
00:06:26,586 --> 00:06:28,660
-菲尔 你搞毛啊 -天啊
- For god sakes! Phil! - Oh, my god!

144
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:31,320
我还以为你能控制好脾气
I thought you had your anger problem under control!

145
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:32,900
我根本没脾气
I don't have an anger...

146
00:06:33,684 --> 00:06:34,660
我没发脾气
I don't--anger problem.

147
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,740
我脾气可好了
I don't have an anger problem.

148
00:06:37,995 --> 00:06:40,689
慢着 喂 就完了 搞什么啊
Whoa. Hey. It's over? What the hell?

149
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:41,600
你迟到一小时了
You're an hour late.

150
00:06:41,629 --> 00:06:43,540
见到你真好 傻大个
Huh. Good to see you, too, chuckleberry.

151
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,620
快看 你那肥裤现在穿着也合身了嘛[发福]
Look at that. Your oversized pants are starting to fit.

152
00:06:46,808 --> 00:06:48,162
你好 路易斯
Hello, Lewis.

153
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:50,920
你好 菲兹宝
Hello, Fizbo.

154
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:52,880
有那么几年
For several years,

155
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:55,280
我俩组了个很有名的小丑二人组
I was one half of the renowned clown duo

156
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,439
叫"菲兹宝与路易斯"
Fizbo & Lewis.

157
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:57,540
当时可有名了
We were huge.

158
00:06:57,540 --> 00:06:59,220
儿童中的名人
In children's parties.

159
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:02,120
在认识米奇尔不久后 我就退出了
Anyway, I disbanded the group shortly after I met Mitchell.

160
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:05,040
同时谈恋爱和演小丑实在太难了
It's hard to have a relationship and a clown career.

161
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,520
所以许多小丑演员都是单身
That's the reason there are so many single clowns.

162
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:08,300
只是原因之一啦
Just one of the reasons.

163
00:07:08,517 --> 00:07:11,440
从此 路易斯再没理过我
Anyway, um, Lewis hasn't spoken to me since.

164
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,680
他还生我的气 但我不怪他
He's still bitter, and I don't blame him.

165
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,280
就像是因我导致甲壳虫乐队解散
It's kind of like I broke up the Beatles.

166
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:17,360
儿童版的甲壳虫
Of children's parties.

167
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,760
要不一起去酒吧聚聚吧
What do you say we hit a bar?

168
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,400
缅怀一下艾尔
Tip a few back to Al, huh?

169
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,440
听说你坐牢了
I heard you were in jail.

170
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:25,060
是吗 我听说你仍在表演大剪刀的傻逼把戏
Yeah? I heard you're still doing that lame giant scissors bit,

171
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:25,980
你个蓝发傻帽
You blue-haired hack.

172
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,120
谁来
Who's in?

173
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,500
-我去 -我去
- I'll go. - I'll go.

174
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:30,060
等我一会儿 我去补补妆
Just give me a minute. I gotta redo my lips.

175
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:31,540
好的 萨维泽
All right. Cerveza.

176
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:34,260
你来吗 菲仔
What about you, Fizzy?

177
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:37,020
你是来呢 还是让大家都散伙呢
You gonna come or you gonna break up this party, too?

178
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,860
喂 上车吧 傻逼们
Hey, shotgun, bitches!

179
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,820
我还是 还是去吧
I should, you know, probably go.

180
00:07:44,820 --> 00:07:47,020
-你懂的 为了艾尔 -当然
- You know, for--for Al. - Oh, yeah, no, of course.

181
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:48,740
不过 别让他为难你 好吗
But, hey, listen, don't let him get to you, all right?

182
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:51,200
没事儿 一切都已经过去了 只是喝杯酒
No. It's fine. It's all seltzer under the bridge.

183
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:53,380
就喝一杯 然后就回家
Just one drink, and then I'll be home.

184
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,500
好的 你先送我回家吗
Okay. Just drive me home first?

185
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:56,280
不不 你把车开走吧
No, you, uh, you--you take the car.

186
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,040
我跟他们一起走
I, uh, I'll go with the guys.

187
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,760
就那小车 怎么挤得下啊
In that tiny car? How are you all possibly gonna...

188
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:07,360
当我没说过
Forget I asked!

189
00:08:15,292 --> 00:08:16,631
才早上五点啊
It's 5:00 in the morning.

190
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,560
爸爸在玩杂耍
Daddy's juggling!

191
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:21,260
莉莉 你在那上面干嘛
Lily, honey, what are you doing up?

192
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,220
你刚到家吗
Are you just getting home?

193
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:23,400
是的 情况有点失控了
Yeah, things got a little out of hand.

194
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,920
有人龙舌兰酒喝多了
Somebody had a flower that squirted tequila.

195
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,400
什么叫"有人" 请叫我大名
What do you mean "Somebody"? I want full credit.

196
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:28,940
有事吗 红毛
What up, red?

197
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:30,140
不是吧
Really?

198
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,740
教我玩杂耍
Teach me to juggle!

199
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:32,920
很简单
It's very simple.

200
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:34,260
诀窍在于
The key is to

201
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:37,360
时刻小心别撞到旁边的东西
be aware of where everything is at all times.

202
00:08:40,118 --> 00:08:43,262
而且别忘了要保持平衡
And don't forget the importance of balance! Oh!

203
00:08:43,380 --> 00:08:45,140
好了 好了 别闹了
Okay. Okay. Come on.

204
00:08:45,260 --> 00:08:46,760
我的蛋蛋撞破了
I think I cracked my eggs.

205
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:49,020
我们没蛋了吗
We're out of eggs?

206
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,066
开什么玩笑
Are you yolking?

207
00:08:50,066 --> 00:08:53,101
我五天没吃蛋了
And I haven't eaten in five days!

208
00:08:54,727 --> 00:08:56,964
五天啦 你不是"片"我吧[麦片]
Five days! Are you cereal?

209
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:01,340
莉莉 千万别学他
Lily, don't ever do that.

210
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:09,880
好啊 你俩是故意不加我好友的
Okay. You two are deliberately not confirming me.

211
00:09:09,890 --> 00:09:12,780
其他人都接受我的好友请求了
Everybody else has accepted my facebook requests--

212
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:14,460
你们老爸 米奇尔舅舅
Your father, uncle Mitchell...

213
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,140
阿黛尔
Adele.

214
00:09:16,140 --> 00:09:18,820
没错 阿黛尔都接受我的好友申请了
That's right. Adele has agreed to be my friend,

215
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,920
我亲生闺女都不加我
And my own daughters haven't.

216
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,420
是啊 你大概只是一个阿黛尔的歌迷
Yeah, you may just be a fan of Adele, and--

217
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:25,060
到底是有多私密的东西不能让我看啊
What is so private that I can't possibly see it?

218
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:25,640
什么都没有
Nothing.

219
00:09:27,020 --> 00:09:29,220
什么都没 所以就是打心底不想加我
Nothing. You just don't want to be my friend.

220
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:32,060
很好 我知道下一个状态该怎么更新了
Great. I can see my next status update--

221
00:09:32,540 --> 00:09:33,800
"我家闺女是禽兽"
"My daughters are monsters."

222
00:09:34,078 --> 00:09:36,198
真是难以置信
You're not gonna believe this.

223
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,380
米茨抢到了那房的代理
Mitzi got the listing.

224
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:39,440
哦不亲爱的 太糟糕了
Oh, no, honey. That's awful.

225
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:41,700
她使阴招 说瞎话 无耻取胜
She cheated, she lied, and she won.

226
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:42,800
大家围过来
Kids, gather 'round.

227
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:44,400
再说一遍 我们也没离很远
Again, we are gathered.

228
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:47,540
想要出人头地 就别按规矩办事
You wanna get ahead? Don't play by the rules.

229
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:48,940
才发现好人一般没好报
Turns out nice guys finish last

230
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:51,340
冰冷无情 弱肉强食的世界啊
In this cold, dog-eat-dog world.

231
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:53,980
不公平啊 你为什么不也玩点阴的
It's not fair. Why don't you play dirty, too?

232
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,520
凭你拿下她还不容易
You could take her down.

233
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:58,040
宝贝 因为你家老爸不是那么卑鄙的人
Honey, 'cause your dad is a better man than that.

234
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,800
他有高尚的价值观 道德观..
He has values and morals and--

235
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:00,760
你 接着说
You. Keep talking.

236
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:03,760
好的 我首先能想到的就是
Well, just off the top of my head,

237
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:07,360
你可以用我的间谍笔录下她供认的罪状
You could take my spy pen and record her admitting what she did.

238
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,080
然后你再拿去播给那些人听
And then you could play it for those people

239
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,800
让他们知道她是多混蛋的一人
So they realize what a jerk she is.

240
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,720
你们老爸是绝对不会
Your dad is never gonna

241
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,320
-那样做的 -你今天真是个唠叨婆
- do that-- - you're a regular chatterbox today!

242
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,431
赶紧把那笔给我
Get me that pen!

243
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:20,960
-我来开门 -记住 小子 别太夸张
- I got it! - Remember, pal, keep it simple.

244
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:24,160
嘿 曼尼
Hey, Manny.

245
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:27,060
格里芬 希腊神话里的传奇生物
Griffin--legendary creature of greek mythology

246
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:28,940
有着狮子的头颅和老鹰的翅膀
With the head of a lion and wings of an eagle.

247
00:10:29,498 --> 00:10:30,847
这不夸张吧 杰
What'd you say, Jay?

248
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:31,720
当我没说
Never mind.

249
00:10:35,732 --> 00:10:37,369
在下杰·普里契特 很高兴见到你
Jay Pritchett. Nice to meet you.

250
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:38,140
我也很高兴见到你
Nice to meet you, too.

251
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:43,820
上周我去看了你们学校的篮球赛
You know, I, I saw a little of that basketball game of yours last week.

252
00:10:43,820 --> 00:10:45,680
你小子可是闪亮全场啊
You were lightin' it up.

253
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,120
过奖
Thanks.

254
00:10:46,580 --> 00:10:48,060
我当时也"闪亮"了全场 杰
I was lighting it up, too, Jay.

255
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,240
谁最闪亮 我最闪亮
Who's hot? We're hot!

256
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,860
野马队最闪亮
Mustangs are hot!

257
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:57,460
好啊 格里芬 最近可好
Hola, Griffin. How are you?

258
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,380
我挺好的
I'm fine.

259
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,460
你们俩小男子汉今天准备干些什么啊
So what do you boys have planned for today?

260
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,980
这个嘛 算是给格里芬的一个惊喜
Well, it's kind of a surprise for Griffin,

261
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:10,060
不过小小透露下和剪纸工艺有关
But let's just say it involves decoupage.

262
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:11,735
-哦 天啊 -来吧 咱们走
- Oh, jeez. - Come on. Let's go.

263
00:11:12,981 --> 00:11:14,033
待会儿见
Good-bye.

264
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:18,980
不好
Oh, no.

265
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,940
-怎么了 -你说得对
- What? - You were right.

266
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,380
那个男孩来这儿不是为了见曼尼
This boy is not here to see Manny.

267
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,460
早跟你说了 注意到他看我的眼神了不
I told you. You see the way he looks at me?

268
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:28,770
少来 方茨 注意到他看我的眼神了吗
No, Fonzie, the way he looks at me.

269
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:31,160
话都说不出来 俩眼直勾勾的
He couldn't talk. He kept staring.

270
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:33,720
他就像我上学那会儿班上的老师一样
He was just like my teachers back in school.

271
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:35,460
歌洛莉亚 我知道你很美
Gloria, you're very pretty.

272
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,520
但我才是那小子的偶像
But the kid idolizes me.

273
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,480
是吗
Really?

274
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,620
格里芬 曼尼
Griffin! Manny!

275
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:44,460
你们是想和杰一起去骑他的摩托车
Do you want to go with Jay to ride his motorcycle,

276
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:46,320
还是想和我一起去超市
Or you want to go with me to the supermarket

277
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,680
买点洋葱回来
And buy a couple of onions?

278
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:48,940
骑摩托车
Motorcycle rides!

279
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,080
洋葱听起来不错
Onions sound good.

280
00:11:54,402 --> 00:11:56,233
我想他对你也有点意思吧
Guess he has a thing for you, too.

281
00:11:58,020 --> 00:11:59,220
嘿 我们回来啦
Hey! We're back!

282
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,251
嘿 我...我可才把厨房收拾干净
Hey, I-I just finished cleaning the kitchen,

283
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:02,840
你们谁要是还想表演喷水的戏码
So if anyone has to do a spit take,

284
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:03,800
麻烦到水池那去
Please do it over the sink.

285
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:07,200
那天实在不好意思 这个礼物是给你的
We felt really bad about that, so we got you a present.

286
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,560
这...这又在耍什么花样呢
What--what's the deal with this?

287
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,960
我一打开就蹦出来一条蛇 还是一团火
I open it up and snakes fly out, or a fire?

288
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,820
不 我们只是觉得你热爱阅读
No, we just know that you like to read.

289
00:12:12,820 --> 00:12:14,021
是啊 赶紧打开吧
Yeah. So open it.

290
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:16,069
哈 捉弄成功
Aah! Got him!

291
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:18,440
没有 这场景完全是在我的意料之内
No. No. That's exactly what I expected.

292
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,660
忘了吗 我刚说什么来着
'member, when I told you?

293
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:20,960
好了 时候不早要上路了
Okay. Look, it's almost go time,

294
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,640
我们该先去喝一杯 然后把脸白上
So we should have a shot and go white up.

295
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:25,080
我没听错吧 "把脸白上"
I'm sor--excuse me. "White up"?

296
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,160
是啊 路易斯下午接到一个生日宴的活
Oh, yeah. Lewis got a call to do a birthday party this afternoon,

297
00:12:27,170 --> 00:12:28,800
所以我们准备将老把戏都再耍起来
So we're gonna put the old act back together.

298
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:31,457
对 菲兹宝和路易斯 二丑归来
Yeah, Fizbo & Lewis, together again.

299
00:12:31,457 --> 00:12:32,620
别人都说这是不可能的事情
And they said it would never happen.

300
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:34,020
说 且希望如此
Said. Hoped.

301
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,400
能和你单独聊一会儿吗
Could I talk to you for a second?

302
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,520
不妙 "基堂里的烦恼"
Uh-oh. Trouble in queer-a-dise.

303
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,300
好吧 我去车里和香烟共享私密时间了
Okay, look, gonna go out to the car for smokes.

304
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:43,180
你别跟我你们车里有个小丑叫"香烟"
Please tell me "Smokes" is not another clown,

305
00:12:43,180 --> 00:12:45,090
再来一个他这样的我可受不了
'cause I don't think I could handle another one of him.

306
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:46,480
路易斯没那么讨人厌
Oh, Lewis is not that bad.

307
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:48,060
那你觉得他有什么优点 小卡
Well, what do you see in that guy, Cam?

308
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,500
说不清 我只知道
I don't know. Maybe the fact that

309
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:51,980
每当我谈起小丑艺术时 他从不会对我翻白眼
he doesn't roll his eyes every time I talk about the art of clowning...

310
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:53,200
说的就是你
Like that.

311
00:12:53,460 --> 00:12:54,920
他或许的确有很多缺点
He may have had his faults

312
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,100
不过我们搭档超棒的
but we were great together.

313
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,620
我们总能心有灵犀
We had an unspoken language.

314
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:59,760
我们互相帮助对方吹充气动物
We finished each other's balloon animals.

315
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,920
不过你怕是永远不懂
But you would never know,

316
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:04,620
因为我们的表演你可是一场也没去过
Because you have never been to one of our performances.

317
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:06,740
生日聚会罢了
Birthday parties.

318
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:08,860
你讨厌我的小丑身份
You hate my clown side.

319
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:11,440
不不 我并不是讨厌
No. No. No. I don't hate it.

320
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:13,900
就承认了吧 我基本已经确定了
Just admit it. I basically already know you do.

321
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,180
好吧 好吧 把话挑明了
Okay. Okay. Cards on the table.

322
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,660
-我确实不是太喜欢你... -你真无礼
- It's not my favorite thing that you-- -Oh, how dare you?

323
00:13:19,780 --> 00:13:22,300
我是个小丑 那是我的身份之一
I am a clown. It's who I am!

324
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,160
你捏我的时候 我会不叫吗
If you squeeze me, do I not honk?

325
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,220
又翻白眼了
Eye roll!

326
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,720
我有得选吗
Oh, like I had a choice!

327
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,940
敲敲 敲敲
Knock, knock.

328
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:33,700
你来干嘛
What are you doing here?

329
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:36,500
我给你带了些 汤
Hey, um, I-I brought you some... soup.

330
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:39,460
那个 我想了想 可能我确实是推了你
You know, I thought about it, and maybe I did push you.

331
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,880
脚踝怎么样了
So... how's the ankle?

332
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,060
拜托 邓菲 你明知道我是假摔
Oh, come on, Dunphy. You know I flopped.

333
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:46,940
你是没看过NBA吗
Haven't you ever seen an NBA game?

334
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,120
抱歉 你看的该是女子NBA才对
Oh, I'm sorry. In your case, WNBA.

335
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,180
所以那只是个骗局
So that was all a ruse?

336
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:53,620
"诡计书"里最老的一招了
The oldest trick in the book.

337
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,480
你得提高"技术"啊 孩子
You need to step up your game, son.

338
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:58,560
你知道吗 我都要为你感到难过了
You know what? I almost feel sorry for you.

339
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:00,920
过来 好好拥抱一下
Come here. Give me a big hug.

340
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,360
好了
Oh, yeah. Yeah.

341
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:05,120
你没有很不爽吧
No hard feelings, huh?

342
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,400
-一点没有 -那好
- None at all. - Good.

343
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,960
因为我刚刚把你整个的招供
Because I just recorded your entire confession...

344
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,840
都录在了我的
right here on my...

345
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,600
间谍笔上
Spy pen?

346
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,840
"诡计书"里第二老的招数
Second-oldest trick in the book.

347
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:18,560
老天 你要是个爷们 就直接在汤里下毒了
Oh, god. A real man would have just poisoned the soup.

348
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:22,120
说完了吗
Are we... done here?

349
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,560
谢谢你
Ah. Thank you.

350
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,840
妈妈 告诉你
Hey, mom. Guess what?

351
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,680
格里芬邀请我们今晚都去他家
Griffin invited us all over to his house

352
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,320
参加泳池派对和烧烤
for a pool party and barbecue tonight.

353
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,420
泳池派对哈
Pool party, huh?

354
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:38,120
他说带上你们的泳衣
Yeah, and he said bring your swimsuits.

355
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,600
说的还很坚决
He was pretty adamant about it.

356
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,140
外面气温就10摄氏度
It's 50 degrees outside.

357
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:42,140
听起来不错
Sounds fun.

358
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,300
太好了 我去给他打电话
Great. I'll call him.

359
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:48,500
你这基本上是答应了跟一个13岁男孩约会
You know, you're basically agreeing to a date with a 13-year-old boy.

360
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:51,560
杰 靠我的大胸 我们得以在餐厅订到位置
Jay, we use this go get us tables at restaurants,

361
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:53,320
为什么就不能靠这个给曼尼搞个朋友呢
Why can't we use this to get Manny a friend?

362
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,880
因为他并不真的能得到一个朋友
Because he's not really getting a friend.

363
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,180
可当你之前以为
Oh, but when you thought that

364
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:58,380
他是想骑你的摩托车的时候 就没问题是吧
he was trying to ride your motorcycle, it was okay.

365
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,720
或许是他现在想"骑"的东西让我不爽
Maybe now I don't like what he's trying to ride.

366
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,240
曼尼喜欢格里芬
Manny likes Griffin.

367
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:04,780
可能哪天 如果他俩相处的时间够长
Maybe someday, if they spend enough time together,

368
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:05,900
格里芬会喜欢曼尼呢
Griffin will like manny.

369
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:07,700
什么 格里芬不喜欢我
What? Griffin doesn't like me?

370
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:11,280
不不 宝贝儿 他很喜欢你
No, no, no, papi. He loves you.

371
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:13,780
可你刚刚说有一天他会喜欢我的
But you just said someday Griffin will like me.

372
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:15,080
那就说明他现在不喜欢我
That means he doesn't like me now.

373
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:15,940
告诉你吧 孩子
You know what, kid?

374
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:21,820
我们在想格里芬跟你在一起玩
We think that Griffin might be hanging out with you

375
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:24,460
可能是因为他喜欢你妈妈和我
because he's got a little crush on your mother and me.

376
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:27,415
-还有你 -哇 我简直不敢相信
- On you? - Wow. I can't believe it.

377
00:15:27,415 --> 00:15:29,760
-听着 这没什么 你会没事的 -真抱歉
- Listen, it's fine. You're gonna be fine. Okay? - I'm sorry.

378
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:31,600
开什么玩笑 简直太好了
Are you kidding? It's fantastic!

379
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:32,960
这怎么就太好了
How is it fantastic?

380
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:34,500
我跟他在一起玩
I'm only hanging out with him

381
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:36,160
只是因为我喜欢他妹妹克洛伊
because I have the hots for his sister chloe.

382
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,360
你们也见过格里芬了 他就是个蠢蛋
You've met Griffin. The kid's a doorknob.

383
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,980
所以你是在利用他
So you're just using him?

384
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:44,000
是啊 而且直到刚才 我还觉得挺愧疚的
Yeah, and I felt really guilty about it until now.

385
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,880
现在是双赢了
Now it's a win-win.

386
00:15:45,032 --> 00:15:46,254
对我来说可不是
Not for me!

387
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:47,500
你就忍忍吧 妈妈
Just suck it up, mom.

388
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,260
多年来我为你做的够多了
I've done a lot for you over the years.

389
00:15:49,271 --> 00:15:52,195
杰你也是 那女孩可能就是我的真命天女
Jay, you, too. This girl could be the one.

390
00:15:52,227 --> 00:15:54,104
以后我再也不会烦你们了
Then I'm out of your hair forever.

391
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:55,980
泳池派对哦 妈妈 穿着适当点
Pool party, mom. Dress accordingly.

392
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,120
你能帮我拿一下那盒麦片吗
Can you help me reach that box of cereal?

393
00:16:04,639 --> 00:16:06,611
嘿 你是米茨·罗斯
Hey. You're Mitzi Roth.

394
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,440
我看过你的广告
I recognize you from your ads.

395
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,980
是不是很性感
Smokin', right?

396
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:10,900
我是卢克·邓菲
I'm Luke Dunphy.

397
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,280
我爸是菲尔·邓菲
My dad's Phil Dunphy.

398
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:13,720
真抱歉
I'm sorry.

399
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,640
你为什么那么讨厌他
Why do you hate him so much?

400
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:17,920
生意场上皆敌人 孩子 并不是针对你爸
It's just business, kid. It's not personal.

401
00:16:18,860 --> 00:16:20,960
可你影响到我们家了
Well, it's personal to us.

402
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,800
我以前没见过我爸那么担心过
I've never seen my dad so worried before.

403
00:16:24,270 --> 00:16:25,832
我用间谍笔窃听
I have this spy pen,

404
00:16:25,974 --> 00:16:27,929
听到他跟我妈谈话
and I heard him talking to my mom,

405
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:30,960
他很担心明年付不起我姐姐的大学学费
and he's scared about paying for my sister's college next year.

406
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:34,200
貌似他还在担心什么派对
And I guess he's nervous about some kind of party,

407
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:36,480
因为他说到有个什么气球付款
Because he said there's a big balloon payment.

408
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,200
总而言之吧 他简直就是最好的爸爸
Anyways, he's like the best dad ever,

409
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:43,940
所以你是不是能对他稍微好点
So maybe you could be a little nicer to him.

410
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,020
你在这呢 孩子
There you are, buddy.

411
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:46,860
看看 他们在派送免费糖豆
Check it out. They're giving away free jelly beans.

412
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:49,380
嗨 米茨
Hey, Mitzi.

413
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:50,380
邓菲
Dunphy.

414
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,460
你儿子可真乖
You have a very nice kid there.

415
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:54,220
他是我的
He's mine.

416
00:16:59,681 --> 00:17:02,280
我在想 在演过小菲茨宝之后
Hey, so I was thinking after, uh, little Fizbo,

417
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,500
我们可以演梯子那个
We could do the ladder bit.

418
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:05,580
我去 我都忘了那梯子了
Ah, crap. I forgot the ladder.

419
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:07,500
下周末我会记得的
You know, I'll remember it next weekend.

420
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:08,900
下周末是什么
What's next weekend?

421
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:11,920
我们在千橡市有个演出
We got a town fair in Thousand Oaks

422
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,660
以及帕萨迪纳市有场生日会
and a birthday party in Pasadena.

423
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,664
说什么呢 我没法去
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. I-I can't do that.

424
00:17:15,845 --> 00:17:16,540
你什么意思
W-what do you mean?

425
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:18,120
帕萨迪纳警方要抓的人可是我
I'm the one with outstanding warrants in Pasadena.

426
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,840
下周末我们要带莉莉去水族馆
We're taking Lily to the aquarium next weekend.

427
00:17:20,840 --> 00:17:24,105
路易斯 你知道合作仅此一次 对吗
You know, Lewis, this was just a onetime thing, right?

428
00:17:24,403 --> 00:17:27,040
不是说好"我们双丑合璧 再战江湖"吗
What happened to "We're putting the act back together"?

429
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,280
只是对今天而言
Well, that was just for today.

430
00:17:28,792 --> 00:17:31,542
噢 当然了
Oh. Oh, sure.

431
00:17:31,777 --> 00:17:34,740
-我很抱歉让你误会 -不用
- I'm--I'm sorry if you thought... - No, no, no.

432
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:35,780
我理解
I get it.

433
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:37,020
你现在是居家男人
You're a family man now.

434
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:43,100
我们出去让此次表演成为
Let's go out there and make this

435
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:45,360
菲茨宝 & 路易斯秀史上最精彩的一场
the best show Fizbo & Lewis have ever done.

436
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:48,420
没问题 搭档
You got it, partner.

437
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:52,440
女士们细菌们 男生们女生们
Ladies and germs, boys and girls,

438
00:17:52,740 --> 00:17:55,200
来见见我的好朋友
say hello to my good friend...

439
00:17:55,210 --> 00:17:58,289
小菲茨宝
little Fizbo!

440
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,820
大家好 巨人们
Hello, big people!

441
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,560
你好
Hi!

442
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:09,560
派对开始啦
Let's get this party started!

443
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:17,920
跳舞让我觉得好饿啊
Wow, all this dancing sure has made me hungry!

444
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:20,080
要是有东西吃就好了
Wish I had something to eat!

445
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:24,840
忘了那边有条鱼
Oh, forgot I had that fish over there.

446
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:26,340
搞不懂他为何如此生我的气
Don't know why he's so mad at me!

447
00:18:26,350 --> 00:18:27,987
刚才还好好的
He was fine just a minute ago.

448
00:18:28,194 --> 00:18:29,520
噢 好吧
Ohh! Okay!

449
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:31,440
某人今天出拳很猛啊
Somebody's a little punchy today!

450
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,029
干什么
Oh. Hey.

451
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,380
怎么有煎锅在这里
What's the frying pan doing here?

452
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:35,760
什么时候表演需要煎锅的
When did we add a frying pan to the act?

453
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:37,260
不需要 不 不需要煎锅
We don't need-- nope! Don't need the frying pan!

454
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,560
你为什么要打我 别打了
Why are you doing that? Stop doing that.

455
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:41,840
去死吧 叛徒
Screw you, you traitor.

456
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:43,280
很疼好吧
Ow! That hurts!

457
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:43,980
说真的 住手
Seriously, stop it!

458
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:45,360
知道什么疼吗 被抛弃才疼
Know what hurts? Abandonment.

459
00:18:50,237 --> 00:18:52,797
听听他们的笑声 我们本可以出名的
Listen to 'em laughing. We could have been something.

460
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:55,200
我们本可以红起来的 我一人可成不了笑星
We could have been some-- I can't do this bit by myself!

461
00:19:00,660 --> 00:19:02,720
来人啊 来人啊 这不是表演
Somebody! Somebody! This isn't pretend!

462
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:05,080
快去找个大人来 快啊
Someone grab an adult, please!

463
00:19:10,293 --> 00:19:10,900
米茨
Mitzi.

464
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:12,300
你儿子忘了拿麦片
Your kid forgot his cereal.

465
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:14,820
每盒都有意外小礼物
There's a surprise in every box.

466
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:16,940
剧透下 吃多得糖尿病
Spoiler alert-- it's diabetes.

467
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,520
你大老远开车来就为了送这个
You drove all the way over here for this?

468
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,100
好吧 听我说
Okay, look, here's the deal.

469
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:22,800
如果你想要 那家代理归你了
You can have that listing if you want it.

470
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:25,420
-什么 -那对夫妻很难应付
- What? - Yeah, the couple are a real pain.

471
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:26,860
我已经老得经不起这样的折腾
I'm too old for that kind of headache.

472
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:28,580
你别到处宣传就行
Just keep your mouth shut about it.

473
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:31,420
-太谢谢你了 -我刚说了闭嘴
- Thank you so much. - I just said "Zip it"!

474
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:33,060
-噢 是说过了 -真够白痴
- Oh. You did. - Unbelievable.

475
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:34,500
对不起 谢谢了
I'm so sorry. But thank you.

476
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:35,700
回见
Bye!

477
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:38,860
孩子们 集合了
Kids, gather 'round!

478
00:19:38,980 --> 00:19:40,680
我们就在这里
We are right here!

479
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:45,340
我要告诉你们 人性本善
Let me tell you something-- people are fundamentally good.

480
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:47,520
关键是 要发现他们内心深处的善良
The key is, you find that goodness deep within 'em.

481
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:49,700
操纵之
Twist it,

482
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,340
为己所用
and turn it to your advantage.

483
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:52,540
你好
Hello.

484
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,900
好了 就是她
And... there she is.

485
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:57,420
要说些什么
What are you gonna hit?

486
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:59,840
大学 气球付款 最好的老爸
College, balloon payment, greatest dad ever.

487
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:02,502
很好 要挤点眼泪到你眼中吗
Nice. Do you want me to squirt some tears in your eyes?

488
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,580
爸 拜托
Dad, please.

489
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,540
我学走路前就会假哭了
I was fake crying before I could walk.

490
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:08,000
你以为我是怎么摆脱吃沙拉的
How do you think I got out of eating all those salads?

491
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:16,220
你能帮我拿一下那盒麦片吗
Can you help me reach that box of cereal?

492
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:19,740
嘿 你是米茨·罗斯 是吗
Oh, hey. You're Mitzi Roth, right?

493
00:20:19,740 --> 00:20:21,637
我见过你的广告
I recognize you from your ads.

494
00:20:21,637 --> 00:20:23,349
是不是很性感
Smokin', huh?

495
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:26,160
真不敢相信你把代理权拿回来了
I can't believe you got that listing back!

496
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,865
-宝贝 -亲爱的
- Sweetheart! - Honey!

497
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:29,340
-亲爱的 -什么事
- Honey? - Mm-hmm?

498
00:20:29,733 --> 00:20:30,940
"顶"
Ding?

499
00:20:31,141 --> 00:20:33,709
你确定要"顶"一个唠叨婆吗
You sure you wanna ding a chatterbox?

500
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,560
亲爱的
Honey...

501
00:20:36,871 --> 00:20:38,740
小家伙 快
Buddy, quick--

502
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:39,920
假哭的窍门是什么
What's the trick to those fake tears?

503
00:20:39,931 --> 00:20:41,981
想着"活宝三人组"死绝了
The three stooges are all dead.

504
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:43,780
是啊 妙招啊
Yeah, that's good.

505
00:20:48,540 --> 00:20:51,700
看来某人喜欢酷玩乐队
Well, it looks like somebody likes Coldplay.

506
00:20:52,458 --> 00:20:54,324
是啊 你看见了
Mm. Right. You saw.

507
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:57,440
你们有看到我发的感恩节照片吗
Did you see the pictures I posted from thanksgiving?

508
00:20:57,620 --> 00:20:59,840
灰常可耐
Totes adorbs.

509
00:20:59,840 --> 00:21:00,820
我想死了算了
I'm going to kill myself.

510
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:03,686
你得看我的留言板 这里
You gotta check out my wall. Right there.

511
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,060
1990年春假 新奥尔良
"Spring break, 1990, New Orleans."

512
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,700
那是你吗
Is that you?

513
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:08,460
什么
What?

514
00:21:09,340 --> 00:21:11,580
你大学同学在照片中把你圈了
Some guy from your college tagged you in a picture.

515
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,600
什么叫圈了 什么叫圈了
What is "Tagging"? What is "Tagging"?

516
00:21:13,940 --> 00:21:16,280
你为什么用漏斗喝酒
Why are drinking out of a funnel?

517
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:19,065
为什么会有只手...
Why there's a hand...

518
00:21:19,065 --> 00:21:20,900
好了 取消圈人
Ok, untag it.

519
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:21,680
快取消
Untag it.

520
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,340
